# tint·a, then ×vis), confirmed by measurement 2026-06-12:
#   grass mix  (0.52,0.64,0.33 @ .55) -> (165,175,114) at vis 1.0
#   remembered = ×0.451 (the manufactured 3×3 block west of the player) -> (74,79,51)
#   road  mix  (0.58,0.50,0.38 @ .55) -> (173,156,121)
#   wall keeps the wall tone (0.15,0.14,0.13) -> (38,36,33) — never tinted
